COLOSSEUM BATTLE ENVIRONMENTS 2.0.1 — STANDALONE

Battle/runtime half of Colosseum Overhaul 2.0.1.
Includes the 386 cache-reuse hotfix: existing valid model catalogs are reused; battle-only action banks remain selective/on-demand.
Double Battles and Abilities are production features and default ON for fresh settings.
Compatible with the separate Colosseum Inspired UI Overhaul 3.1.0.
Requires the user-owned Pokemon Colosseum USA GC6E01 source import.
